			"notes": "## First release for Minecraft 26.3\n\nThe full mod from the 1.21.11 version, ported to Minecraft 26.3. Every module, the menu, HUD editor, Fight Report and settings work the same way.\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Fabric Loader 0.20.1 or newer\n- Fabric API 0.166.2+26.3 or newer\n- Java 25\n- Mod Menu (optional, adds a config button to the mod list)\n\n### Changes since 1.0.29\n\n- Player Health Indicators: new \"Max distance\" setting (8 to 64 blocks, default 32). Hearts above players farther away aren't drawn, which saves frame time on crowded servers.\n\n### Note for 26.3\n\nMinecraft 26.3 replaced its input system (SDL instead of GLFW), so keyboard key codes changed. If you copy a config from another Minecraft version, set your module keybinds and Command Keys binds again. Mouse binds carry over."
		},
