			"notes": "## Changes since 1.0.27\n\n- Fight Report: a kill now counts as a win on servers that don't send other players' health. The mod uses the server's death signal, so these fights no longer end as \"Undecided\".\n- Freelook: the mouse wheel moves the camera closer or farther (1 to 20 blocks) while Freelook is active in third person. The hotbar slot doesn't change."
		},
